  "description": "GeminiBastionMCP: Self-hosted OAuth 2.1 Streamable HTTP MCP bastion for Web Gemini, Claude.ai, and ChatGPT with 10 tools, isolated workspaces, Codex SDK orchestration, and a single publish_changes approval gate.",
